msgid "Triton-Ascend max_autotune 使用指南"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend max_autotune Usage Guide"

msgid "文档定位"
msgstr "Document Scope"

msgid "本文面向已经熟悉 Triton-Ascend 自动调优机制的用户，介绍 `max_autotune` 装饰器的高级用法："
msgstr "This article introduces advanced usage of the `max_autotune` decorator for users already familiar with the Triton-Ascend autotune mechanism:"

msgid "`max_autotune` 与标准 `@triton.autotune` 的区别与联系；"
msgstr "The differences and connections between `max_autotune` and the standard `@triton.autotune`;"

msgid "如何利用笛卡尔积展开机制批量生成候选配置；"
msgstr "How to use the Cartesian product expansion mechanism to batch generate candidate configurations;"

msgid "不同 `kernel_type` 支持的调优参数及其适用场景；"
msgstr "The tuning parameters supported by different `kernel_type` values and their applicable scenarios;"

msgid "何时选择 `max_autotune` 而非手写配置列表。"
msgstr "When to choose `max_autotune` instead of a manual configuration list."

msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Getting Started"

msgid "`max_autotune` 是 `@triton.autotune` 的扩展版装饰器，它允许在自动调优前将每个基础配置与额外的调优参数进行笛卡尔积展开，从而大幅减少用户需要手工枚举的配置数量。"
msgstr "`max_autotune` is an extended version of the `@triton.autotune` decorator. Before autotuning, it expands each base configuration into a Cartesian product with additional tuning parameters. This significantly reduces the number of configurations you need to manually enumerate."

msgid "1. 基本用法"
msgstr "1\\. Basic usage"

msgid ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'BLOCK_N': 128}),\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 64, 'BLOCK_N': 256}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=[\"M\", \"N\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"mix\",\n"
"    # 额外的调优参数，每个值必须是列表\n"
"    enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance=[True, False],\n"
"    tile_mix_vector_loop=[2, 4],\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(\n"
"    a_ptr,\n"
"    b_ptr,\n"
"    M,\n"
"    N,\n"
"    BLOCK_M: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    BLOCK_N: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    **META\n"
"):\n"
"    ...\n"
msgstr ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'BLOCK_N': 128}),\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 64, 'BLOCK_N': 256}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=[\"M\", \"N\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"mix\",\n"
"    # Additional tuning parameters, each value must be a list\n"
"    enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance=[True, False],\n"
"    tile_mix_vector_loop=[2, 4],\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(\n"
"    a_ptr,\n"
"    b_ptr,\n"
"    M,\n"
"    N,\n"
"    BLOCK_M: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    BLOCK_N: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    **META\n"
"):\n"
"    ...\n"

msgid "上述配置展开后的等效配置数量为："
msgstr "The number of equivalent configurations after expanding the preceding configuration is:"

msgid "基础配置：2 个"
msgstr "Basic configurations: 2"

msgid "用户提供的调优参数：`enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance`（2 种）、`tile_mix_vector_loop`（2 种）"
msgstr "User-provided tuning parameters: `enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance` (2 types), `tile_mix_vector_loop` (2 types)"

msgid "使用默认值的参数：`set_workspace_multibuffer`（2 种）、`tile_mix_cube_loop`（2 种）、其他参数各 1 种"
msgstr "Parameters using default values: `set_workspace_multibuffer` (2 types), `tile_mix_cube_loop` (2 types), and 1 type for each of the other parameters"

msgid "总配置数量：`2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 32` 个配置。"
msgstr "Total number of configurations: `2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 32` configurations."

msgid "注：`kernel_type=\"mix\"` 支持的参数较多，未显式提供的参数会使用默认值参与展开。如果希望某个参数不参与展开，可在基础 `Config` 的 `kwargs` 中固定其值。"
msgstr "Note: `kernel_type=\"mix\"` supports many parameters. Parameters not explicitly provided use default values during expansion. If you want a parameter to not participate in expansion, fix its value in the `kwargs` of the base `Config`."

msgid "2. `max_autotune` 与 `@triton.autotune` 的关系"
msgstr "2\\. Relationship between `max_autotune` and `@triton.autotune`"

msgid "`max_autotune` 本质上是先调用 `get_max_configs` 对基础配置进行展开，然后将展开后的配置列表传递给标准的 `@triton.autotune`。因此："
msgstr "Essentially, `max_autotune` first calls `get_max_configs` to expand the base configurations, and then passes the expanded list to the standard `@triton.autotune`. Therefore:"

msgid "所有 `@triton.autotune` 支持的参数（`key`、`prune_configs_by`、`reset_to_zero` 等）在 `max_autotune` 中同样有效；"
msgstr "All parameters supported by `@triton.autotune` (`key`, `prune_configs_by`, `reset_to_zero`, and so on) are also valid in `max_autotune`;"

msgid "`max_autotune` 额外增加了 `kernel_type` 参数和 `**tuning_params` 调优参数空间；"
msgstr "`max_autotune` additionally adds the `kernel_type` parameter and the `**tuning_params` tuning parameter space;"

msgid "最终仍然是 `@triton.autotune` 完成 benchmark、选优和缓存。"
msgstr "Ultimately, `@triton.autotune` still performs benchmarking, optimal selection, and caching."

msgid "3. 必须导入 Ascend backend 扩展"
msgstr "3\\. You must import the Ascend backend extension."

msgid "与使用 `configs=[]` 自动 Tiling 一样，`max_autotune` 需要 Ascend backend 扩展支持。`max_autotune` 需要从 Ascend backend 模块单独导入："
msgstr "Like using `configs=[]` for automatic tiling, `max_autotune` requires support from the Ascend backend extension. You must import `max_autotune` separately from the Ascend backend module:"

msgid ""
"from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"
msgstr ""
"from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"

