msgid "Kernel 类型说明"
msgstr "Kernel Type Description"

msgid "**cube**：纯 cube（矩阵乘法类）算子，支持最少的调优参数；"
msgstr "**cube**: Pure cube (matrix multiplication type) operators that support the fewest tuning parameters;"

msgid "**vector**：纯向量算子，仅支持 `num_stages` 和 `enable_ubuf_saving`；"
msgstr "**vector**: pure vector operator, only supports `num_stages` and `enable_ubuf_saving`;"

msgid "**mix**：混合 cube+vector 算子（默认类型），支持最完整的调优参数集合。"
msgstr "**mix**: Mixed cube+vector operators (default type), supporting the most complete set of tuning parameters."

msgid "参数值优先级与展开逻辑"
msgstr "Parameter Value Priority and Expansion Logic"

msgid "参数值优先级"
msgstr "Parameter Value Priority"

msgid "调优参数的值按以下优先级确定："
msgstr "The values of tuning parameters are determined in the following priority order:"

msgid "**tuning_params 参数**（最高优先级）：通过 `**tuning_params` 传递的候选值列表；"
msgstr "**tuning_params parameter** (highest priority): the list of candidate values passed through `**tuning_params`;"

msgid "**基础配置中的值**：如果基础 `Config` 的 `kwargs` 中已存在该参数，则固定为该值（转换为单元素列表）；"
msgstr "**Value in the base configuration**: If the parameter already exists in the `kwargs` of the base `Config`, it is fixed to that value (converted to a single-element list);"

msgid "**默认值**（最低优先级）：从内部默认值表获取。"
msgstr "**Default value** (lowest priority): The value is obtained from the internal default value table."

