msgstr "Applicable Scenarios"

msgid "明确知道 Tiling 参数空间，需要调优编译参数"
msgstr "You know the Tiling parameter space and need to tune compilation parameters."

msgid "希望 Tiling 参数也自动生成"
msgstr "You want Tiling parameters to be automatically generated as well."

msgid "进阶用法"
msgstr "Advanced Usage"

msgid "1. 结合多个调优参数"
msgstr "1\\. Combine multiple tuning parameters"

msgid "对于混合类型算子（`kernel_type=\"mix\"`），可以同时调优多个参数："
msgstr "For mixed-type operators (`kernel_type=\"mix\"`), you can tune multiple parameters simultaneously:"

