msgid "小结"
msgstr "Summary"

msgid "`max_autotune` 是 Triton-Ascend 提供的高级自动调优工具，适合以下场景："
msgstr "`max_autotune` is an advanced autotuning tool provided by Triton-Ascend, suitable for the following scenarios:"

msgid "已知 Tiling 参数空间，希望减少手工枚举配置的工作量；"
msgstr "Given the known Tiling parameter space, you want to reduce the workload of manually enumerating configurations;"

msgid "需要联合调优多个 Ascend 编译参数（如 `num_stages`、`enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance` 等）；"
msgstr "You need to jointly tune multiple Ascend compilation parameters (for example, `num_stages`, `enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance`, and so on);"

msgid "希望通过笛卡尔积方式批量生成候选配置。"
msgstr "You want to generate candidate configurations in batches using the Cartesian product method."

msgid "`max_autotune` 的核心价值在于：用少量基础配置 + 调优参数空间描述，自动展开出完整的候选配置集合，兼顾了灵活性与便利性。"
msgstr "The core value of `max_autotune` is that it uses a small number of base configurations and tuning parameter space descriptions to automatically expand into a complete set of candidate configurations, balancing flexibility and convenience."
